[N 32-33 Arathi Highlands]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Refuge Pointe and Go'Shek Farm: Northfold Manor, Dutiful Steps in Stromgarde, the Hints of a New Plague? chain to its Southshore end, Storm, Earth, and Fire from Veyric, an optional group run on the Stromgarde elites, and the Aerie Peak detour for the shaman trainer and Expert Leatherworking.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 32 (Dutiful Steps and Ground to Keep need 32; the rest need 30). You arrive at about 31.9: if you are still 31, Northfold Manor comes first anyway (its Syndicate are level 30-32) and you will be 32 before Stromgarde. The one hard fight is the |cFFFF0000Forsaken Courier|r: she and her four Forsaken Bodyguards are all level 35 and walk together, so you pull five mobs three or four levels above you - they hit harder, you miss more and you cannot pull her alone. That is why the route leaves her for last, at 32-33: pull from range on open ground, Earthbind Totem down, Frost Shock the runners, and invite anyone else on the road. If it goes badly, let her walk on and catch her next pass (her loop runs from Go'Shek Farm west to Thoradin's Wall and back)
[OC]|cffffcc00Start:|r Southshore after the City of Dalaran (chapter 28); hearth = Southshore and it stays there (Refuge Pointe has no innkeeper in the DB). About 14,550 quest XP on the plain quests and 10,650 more with the optional group block; the only quest money is Ground to Keep's 45s
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r Farseer Maret Firetend in Aerie Peak, at the end of this chapter, trains shamans at Eldrun's prices: your level 32 and 34 ranks are bought there

[O]Did not take and hand in Hints of a New Plague? (659) in chapters 23 and 25? It opens the Go'Shek chain: at [TAR2711 Phin Odelic], [QA659 Hints of a New Plague?] (1,300 XP, requires level 30: find Quae at Go'Shek Farm) [G50.4,59.0 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[OC]|cffffffffRefuge Pointe|r  -  one direct flight; Captain Nials and the Wanted Board stand beside the flight master
At [TAR2432 Darla Harris], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Refuge Pointe]|r [G49.3,52.3 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2700 Captain Nials], [QA681 Northfold Manor] (2,500 XP, requires level 30: 10 Syndicate Highwaymen and 6 Syndicate Mercenaries at Northfold Manor, |cff66ff66normal|r) [G45.8,47.6 Arathi Highlands]
[OC]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r |cffffcc00Wanted Board:|r Otto, Lord Falconcrest and Marez Cowl are level 38-40 ELITES inside Stromgarde Keep. Take the two posters only if you have a group for the Stromgarde block below; they stay for their rewards (Arathi Armbands, Wild Headdress)
[O]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r At the Wanted Board beside Nials, [QA685 WANTED: Otto and Falconcrest] (3,900 XP, requires level 30: Otto's Head ~77% and Falconcrest's Head ~93%) [G46.0,47.8 Arathi Highlands]
[O]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r On the same board, [QA684 WANTED: Marez Cowl] (3,750 XP, requires level 30: Marez's Head ~46% - one kill only, then abandon) [G46.0,47.8 Arathi Highlands]

[OC][A Shaman]|cffffffffVeyric Thunderhame|r  -  walk about 24 map units north-east of Refuge Pointe and approach him from the WEST: Highland Striders and Plains Creepers (30-33) on the way; Fozruk (42 elite), the Cresting Exiles (38-39) and Myzrael (44 elite) stand east of him at about 63-68, 28-34, and Hammerfall's guards further east are level 50. Stay in Ghost Wolf and do not go past him
[A Shaman] At [TAR259023 Veyric Thunderhame], [QA79358 Storm, Earth, and Fire] (shaman only, requires level 30: he gives you The Walks of Shaman. 5 each of the Twisted Fire, Earth, Air and Water Totems from the Stonevault (Badlands), the Lost Ones (Swamp of Sorrows), the Maraudine (Desolace) and the Mirefin (Dustwallow) - collected in chapters 32, 33, 35 and 37 and handed in here in chapter 39 for 3,600 XP) [G59.8,27.6 Arathi Highlands]
[OC][A Shaman] Heed My Call (96135) and The Tempest's Weapons (96016) stay in Veyric's list for the level-40 block (chapters 39 and 39c)
[OC]|cffffffffGo'Shek Farm|r  -  walk about 26 units south. Hammerfall Grunts (34-35) and Peons (33-34), Horde non-elites, fill the farm: stay on its west edge, where Quae and Kinelory stand
[O]At [TAR2712 Quae], [QT659] (1,300 XP) - only if you took it in Southshore at the start of this chapter [G60.2,53.9 Arathi Highlands]
At [TAR2712 Quae], [QA658 Hints of a New Plague?] (2,800 XP, requires level 30: the Sealed Folder from the Forsaken Courier, ~78%, |cff66ff66normal|r - she is the last fight of the chapter, do not hunt her yet) [G60.2,53.9 Arathi Highlands]

[OC]|cffffffffNorthfold Manor|r  -  walk west along the road past Refuge Pointe to the manor (x29-35, y24-33). Highwaymen are level 30-31 and Mercenaries 31-32, 37 spawns between them
