[OC]|cffffffffStromgarde Keep|r  -  walk about 31 units south into the Alliance-held north-west quarter (Deneb Walker's corner from chapter 25). The Stromgarde Vindicators and Defenders there (38-40 elites) are friendly. The rest of the keep is elite: Syndicate to the south (Conjurors, Prowlers and Magi 35-38, Darbel Montrose a level 39 rare elite) and Boulderfist ogres to the west
At [TAR2782 Caretaker Alaric] by the crypt, [QA92872 Dutiful Steps] (2,850 XP, requires level 32: throw the Pouch of Tomb Dust into the Great Sea, |cff66ff66normal|r). Alaric is friendly; come in from the north and do not step south of him - Syndicate Magi, Conjurors, Prowlers (all elite) and Darbel Montrose stand 1-2 units south [G29.0,59.7 Arathi Highlands]
Walk south-east to the shore by the goblin camp at Faldir's Cove (the road south from Refuge Pointe leads there) and use the Pouch of Tomb Dust at the water's edge. The DB has no throw spot: this is the nearest shore without elites, |cffffcc00unverified|r that it counts [QC92872] [G33.0,82.0 Arathi Highlands]
