[O]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r Kill [TAR2783 Marez Cowl] (40 elite; he stands at 29.6,63.0 or 29.5,64.1) for Marez's Head (~46% - one kill only, then abandon) [QC684] [G29.6,63.0 Arathi Highlands]
