[OC]|cffffffffAerie Peak|r  -  the Wildhammer town in the Hinterlands has a shaman trainer and the Expert Leatherworking trainer, and its flight point is new to you, so the first trip is on foot. The road is the Classic one, |cffffcc00unverified|r on Forever. Do not take the road north out of Arathi: it runs past Hammerfall's level 50 guards
Walk north-east out of Southshore across the Hillsbrad Fields and through the eastern hills past Durnholde Keep (Syndicate 20-22, Elder Gray Bears and Giant Moss Creepers 24-26: grey or green to you) to the Wildhammer post of Granistad and Kurdros (friendly), at the foot of the pass into the Hinterlands [G84.2,32.8 Hillsbrad Foothills]
