[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r handed in here: Northfold Manor (681), Dutiful Steps (92872, or abandoned if the throw did not count), Hints of a New Plague? (658, 657, 660, 661); with a group Otto and Falconcrest (685), Marez Cowl (684, or abandoned) and Ground to Keep (92867). Shaman: Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358) rides in the log for the totems of chapters 32-37 and goes back to Veyric in chapter 39. Still carried: The Missing Diplomat (1248, chapter 32), Stepping Stones (79192: its next steps are in Stonetalon and at the Loch Modan dam before Thoradin's Wall, not on this round's route) and the quests chapters 27-28 carry on. Nothing from Arathi is left open except 79358. Next: Stranglethorn Vale (chapter 30), flying out from here
